From 886b8ef94852e532bd163f5f1f7b8fa78e681848 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:57:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] BallZ wood floor + per-axis-cap held-key steering; car window
 glass via profile opacity

- BallZ: wood floor over the checker ('damier marble'), warm marble walls
- BallZ controls: held-key continuous steering, capped PER AXIS so braking and
  turning keep full authority at top speed (a global cap silently killed them)
- Cars: recovered-PBR glass profiles now apply their opacity, so VENTANAS/window
  slots render as translucent glass instead of an opaque black slab
